le-p0002","name":"丁原","evidence":["zhangle-q-o001","dongyuan-q-o005","lvzang-q-1ccca52b8ef876068fa8","lvzang-q-6650b0dcab8d51bb1961","lvzang-q-7da401896b0cfe19eaca","lvzang-q-1d5c9a6c11cb5bec3896","lvzang-q-db58db20e08c06624c33","lvzang-q-a79bc64ed35bc3cec74e","gongsuntao-q-7970a3af5fbc2c5f9c92"],"facts":[{"id":"lvzang-f-review-a0a0d11ea5efc81dd660","text":"英雄记记：字建阳，本出自寒家；为人粗略，有武勇，善骑射；为南县吏，受使不辞难，有警急追寇虏辄在其前；才知书，少有吏用","evidence":["lvzang-q-db58db20e08c06624c33"]}],"aliases":[],"mentions":[{"id":"zhangle-m-o001-zhangle-p0002","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["zhangle-q-o001"]},{"id":"dongyuan-m-o005-zhangle-p0002","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["dongyuan-q-o005"]},{"id":"lvzang-m-review-c99b9864f07d37980532","kind":"mention","text":"丁原见于相关言论或记载。","evidence":["lvzang-q-1d5c9a6c11cb5bec3896"]}]}],"evidence":[{"id":"dongyuan-e-o005d-q","section":"chapter-006","block":"b-ef2d794a3a83d523b5a3","layer":"original","quote":"卓又使吕布杀执金吾丁原〖8〗，并其众：","section_title":"董二袁刘传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0017.xhtml","index":27,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":84,"end":103,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"dongyuan-q-o005","section":"chapter-006","block":"b-ef2d794a3a83d523b5a3","layer":"original","quote":"卓未至，进败。﹝一﹞中常侍段珪等，劫帝走小平津〖4〗；卓遂将其众迎帝于北芒〖5〗，还宫。﹝二﹞时进弟车骑将军苗，为进众所杀〖6〗。﹝三﹞进、苗部曲无所属〖7〗，皆诣卓；卓又使吕布杀执金吾丁原〖8〗，并其众：故京都兵权唯在卓。﹝四﹞","section_title":"董二袁刘传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0017.xhtml","index":27,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":115,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"gongsuntao-q-7970a3af5fbc2c5f9c92","section":"chapter-008","block":"b-5a06f5471508744b051d","layer":"original","quote":"并州刺史丁原，遣杨将兵诣硕，为假司马","section_title":"二公孙陶四张传第八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0021.xhtml","index":144,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":69,"end":87,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"lvzang-q-1ccca52b8ef876068fa8","section":"chapter-007","block":"b-2c861650a927ec23aeae","layer":"original","quote":"刺史丁原为骑都尉，屯河内；以布为主簿，大见亲待","section_title":"吕布张邈臧洪传第七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0019.xhtml","index":1,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":27,"end":50,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"lvzang-q-1d5c9a6c11cb5bec3896","section":"chapter-007","block":"b-66d8ed1a8c5b129739ae","layer":"original","quote":"刘备进曰：“明公不见布之事丁建阳及董太师乎〖8〗！”太祖颔之〖9〗。布因指备曰：“是儿最叵信者〖10〗！”﹝五﹞于是缢杀布〖11〗。布与宫、顺等皆枭首送许，然后葬之","section_title":"吕布张邈臧洪传第七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0019.xhtml","index":99,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":82,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"lvzang-q-6650b0dcab8d51bb1961","section":"chapter-007","block":"b-53c0cb3176e9e7cfe412","layer":"original","quote":"灵帝崩，原将兵诣洛阳。﹝一﹞与何进谋诛诸黄门，拜执金吾","section_title":"吕布张邈臧洪传第七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0019.xhtml","index":2,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":27,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"lvzang-q-7da401896b0cfe19eaca","section":"chapter-007","block":"b-53c0cb3176e9e7cfe412","layer":"original","quote":"进败，董卓入京都；将为乱，欲杀原，并其兵众。卓以布见信于原，诱布令杀原；布斩原首，诣卓","section_title":"吕布张邈臧洪传第七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0019.xhtml","index":2,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":28,"end":71,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"lvzang-q-a79bc64ed35bc3cec74e","section":"chapter-007","block":"b-27d7a1db89264afa6c22","layer":"pei","quote":"为南县吏，受使不辞难。有警急，追寇虏，辄在其前","attribution":"英雄记","section_title":"吕布张邈臧洪传第七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0019.xhtml","index":7,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-380cb13583f181638449","start":35,"end":58,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"lvzang-q-db58db20e08c06624c33","section":"chapter-007","block":"b-27d7a1db89264afa6c22","layer":"pei","quote":"原字建阳。本出自寒家，为人粗略，有武勇，善骑射。为南县吏，受使不辞难。有警急，追寇虏，辄在其前。才知书，少有吏用","attribution":"英雄记","section_title":"吕布张邈臧洪传第七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0019.xhtml","index":7,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-380cb13583f181638449","start":11,"end":67,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhangle-e-o001b-q","section":"chapter-017","block":"b-dce09ba3edeac4fce824","layer":"original","quote":"汉末，并州刺史丁原，以辽武力过人，召为从事。使将兵诣京都。","section_title":"张乐于张徐传第十七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0039.xhtml","index":1,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":36,"end":65,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhangle-q-o001","section":"chapter-017","block":"b-dce09ba3edeac4fce824","layer":"original","quote":"张辽字文远，雁门马邑人也〖1〗。本聂壹之后〖2〗，以避怨变姓。少为郡吏。汉末，并州刺史丁原，以辽武力过人，召为从事。使将兵诣京都。何进遣诣河北募兵，得千余人。还，进败，以兵属董卓。","section_title":"张乐于张徐传第十七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0039.xhtml","index":1,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":90,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
